FLAG long
SET UTF8
TRY abcdefghijklmnoprstuvwyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPRSTUVWYZ

#to-do review "TRY" to use letters based on frequency
# I think the rules below should apply to roots like Actives: lya, lidde, lilya, Causatives: liisa, liisizza, Passives: liibwa, liisibbwa, liisiddwa, liibwa e.g akalya, ekilya, ebilya, alya, alidde, abaalya
#TO-DO: Review the . and the Y to prevent the dictionary from exploding
#TO-DO: Dont forget to make the Luganda letter as in "Ngoma", "Ngombe" to be valid in hunspell
PFX VERB N 72 
PFX VERB 0 tu .
PFX VERB 0 otu .
PFX VERB 0 ka .
PFX VERB 0 aka .
PFX VERB 0 a .
PFX VERB 0 e .
PFX VERB 0 o .
PFX VERB 0 ki .
PFX VERB 0 eki .
